OPEN. All three divergences are now RESOLVED in clautolisp itself:
D1 IMPLEMENTED (1.6.16), D2 closed as contamination (not a divergence),
D3 IMPLEMENTED (1.6.17, verified green 2026-08-06). What remains is NOT
clautolisp code:
  - the D1/D3 cadaptor forks (file the two divergences into the cadaptor
    consumer — external follow-on, another repo); and
  - the selection re-verify, blocked on regenerating a truly-empty
